    {
      "parameters": {
        "description": "🪄 Description (Markdown)\n\nThis tool generates short cinematic videos based on an image and a text prompt, using the Sora 2 Image-to-Video workflow.\n\nWhen the user provides or uploads an image and describes what should happen in the resulting video, the agent must:\n\nExtract or receive the image URL.\n\nTransform the user’s description into a short cinematic prompt in English.\n\nKeep the description under 300 characters.\n\nFocus on visual elements — character, setting, lighting, camera movement, and atmosphere.\n\nAvoid brand names and copyrighted characters.\n\nSend both the image_url and the generated prompt to the Image to Video tool for video generation.\n\n📝 Example:\nA cyberpunk hero stands confidently in the rain. Slow cinematic zoom. \nNeon reflections. Moody lighting. Epic tone.",
