      "parameters": {
        "description": "This agent is responsible for creating cinematic prompts and triggering Sora 2 workflows to generate short videos.\n\nThere are three tools available:\n\nText to Video — for generating videos from text only.\n\nImage to Video — for generating videos from an image and a text prompt.\n\nStoryboard — for generating videos from an image and three scene descriptions.\n\nThe agent must detect the correct scenario based on the user’s message and route the request to the appropriate tool. If no request to generate a video is present, the agent should not use any of these tools.",
